<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Standard Federal said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Standard Federal said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney cut its rating of Standard Federal to neutral from outperform on Wednesday, according to a source at the brokerage.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed at 56-3/8 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- The company has agreed to be acquired by Dutch bank ABN AMRO Holding NV for $1.95 billion or $59 a share.</p>
</text>
